      ],
      "impact": "If R12 is populated, the /PWM2 signal is shorted directly to GND, disabling channel 2 PWM and potentially damaging the driving GPIO. The M5Stack bus pin 22 is also tied to GND instead of being available as the PWM2 selection pin.",
